# Seragen Workflow System - Deep Analysis & Context Document

> **Purpose**: Comprehensive technical analysis of the Seragen project structure, ticket creation feature, permission model, and identified issues/improvements.
> 
> **Last Updated**: 2026-01-19

---

## 1. Project Overview

**Seragen** is a **WhatsApp-Driven Workflow Visibility Tool** for managing medical diagnostic and therapeutic service requests.

### Technology Stack

| Component | Technology | Notes |
|-----------|------------|-------|
| Framework | Next.js 15 (App Router) | Server-side rendering, API routes |
| Database | Supabase (PostgreSQL) | Hosted PostgreSQL with real-time capabilities |
| UI | React + Tailwind CSS + Framer Motion | Custom component library in `src/components/ui` |
| Auth | Custom cookie-based sessions | Base64-encoded session data (NOT JWT!) |
| Validation | Zod + React Hook Form | Client-side form validation |
| Password | bcryptjs | 12 rounds for hashing |

