### Ticket UID Generation

A PostgreSQL trigger automatically generates UIDs in format `TKT-YYYYMMDD-XXXX`:
```sql
-- Example: TKT-20260119-0001, TKT-20260119-0002
BEFORE INSERT trigger calls generate_ticket_uid()
```

