## 3. User Roles & Permissions (CORRECTED)

> ⚠️ **Important**: The `auth.ts` file contains helper functions that are NOT consistently used across the codebase. This section reflects the ACTUAL behavior based on code analysis.

### Role Definitions

```typescript
type UserRole = 'admin' | 'manager' | 'customer_success' | 'field_executive'
```

### Actual Permission Matrix (Verified from Code)

| Action | Admin | Manager | Customer Success | Field Executive |
|--------|-------|---------|------------------|-----------------|
| **View All Tickets** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ (assigned only) |
| **Create Tickets** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| **Edit Ticket Metadata** | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| **Change Workflow Status** | ✅ | ✅ | ⚠️ (via API bug) | ✅ (own tickets) |
| **Assign Tickets** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Delete Tickets** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Manage Users** | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Manage Settings** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| **Copy Ticket Details** | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |

### Permission Implementation Locations

| Permission | Checked In | Actual Code |
|------------|------------|-------------|
| Create Tickets | `POST /api/tickets` | `canCreateTickets(session.role)` ✅ |
| Edit Metadata | `PATCH /api/tickets/[id]` | Inline role check (admin/manager/CS) ✅ |
| Change Status | `POST /api/status-transitions` | **NO ROLE CHECK** ⚠️ |
| Delete Tickets | `DELETE /api/tickets/[id]` | `canEditTickets(session.role)` ✅ |
| Settings Access | `middleware.ts` | roleRoutes mapping ✅ |

