## 9. API Endpoints Reference

### Ticket Operations

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role Check | Purpose |
|--------|----------|------|------------|---------|
| GET | `/api/tickets` | ✅ | FE sees only assigned | List tickets |
| POST | `/api/tickets` | ✅ | `canCreateTickets()` | Create ticket |
| GET | `/api/tickets/[id]` | ✅ | FE sees only assigned | Get single ticket |
| PATCH | `/api/tickets/[id]` | ✅ | Inline check | Update ticket |
| DELETE | `/api/tickets/[id]` | ✅ | `canEditTickets()` | Delete ticket |

### Status Operations

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Role Check | Purpose |
|--------|----------|------|------------|---------|
| GET | `/api/status-transitions` | ✅ | None | List transitions |
| POST | `/api/status-transitions` | ✅ | ⚠️ **NONE** | Create transition |

### Supporting Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose |
|--------|----------|---------|
| GET | `/api/hospitals` | List hospitals |
| GET | `/api/doctors` | List doctors (filter by hospital_id) |
| GET | `/api/service-types` | List service types |
| GET | `/api/workflow-stages` | List workflow stages |
| GET | `/api/custom-columns` | List custom columns |
| GET | `/api/field-visibility` | Get visibility settings |
| GET | `/api/assignable-users` | Get users for assignment |
| GET | `/api/labs` | List laboratories |
| GET | `/api/auth/me` | Get current user session |

