## 10. Default Workflow Stages

```sql
('New', '#6b7280', 0),           -- Gray
('Assigned', '#3b82f6', 1),      -- Blue (triggers FE assignment)
('In Progress', '#f59e0b', 2),   -- Amber
('Sample Collected', '#8b5cf6', 3), -- Purple
('Completed', '#10b981', 4),     -- Green
('Cancelled', '#ef4444', 5);     -- Red
```

Additional stages from migration (if applied):
- Sample Sent To (triggers lab selection)
- Sample Received
- Analyzed
- Report Received
- Report Submission

